error: `#[use_interceptors(...)]` belongs on the controller struct beside `#[controller]`, not on this `#[routes]` block — the struct half declares the host's layers, and this half declares its #[get] / #[post] / #[put] / #[patch] / #[delete]. A layer scoped to one operation goes on that operation's method.
